              {"note_id": "n103", "number": 3, "text_md": "一注多引用：两条正文引用都应回链到本注文。", "refs": ["ref-000103", "ref-000104"]},
              {
                "note_id": "n105",
                "number": 4,
                "text_md": "注文内含[链接](https://example.org/note)与图片：\n\n![注内小图](media/note-small.png)",
                "refs": ["ref-000105"]
